  "startedAt": "2026-10-18T03:08:43.679Z",
  "steps": [
    "Cancel remains available while the real directory request is pending. Releasing its late response cannot reopen the creator or write author files.",
    "Four channel presets set valid endpoint defaults. One stable instance and one track with identity/end keys are reviewed alongside both relations. Chinese, English and Japanese at 390px preserve focus, selection, unfinished inputs and approved source. Cancelling writes no author files.",
    "One Save creates exactly the reviewed animation source, its registration and the scene relation; all scene source and other author bytes remain unchanged. A deliberately lost committed response leaves Save disabled; rereading confirms the exact identity/source/relations without another create command.",
    "Opening the newly created source enters the existing editor. Independent keyframe Check and Apply update only the unsaved draft; ordinary Save changes exactly that animation JSON and preserves the track identity.",
    "Reopening scene animation resolves the existing document, offers source editing and keeps the selected scene without allocating or creating another manifest."
  ],
